[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
CK Core CDE 3.0.0 (Wayland + X11) has been installed beneath /usr/dt.

To run the native Wayland session or the dtlogin Wayland greeter on FreeBSD
14.x / 15.x with drm-kmod, evdev, and seatd:

1. Load your GPU KMS driver (i915kms, amdgpu, or radeonkms) and enable evdev:
     sysrc kld_list+="i915kms"

2. Add your desktop user (and _dtgreeter) to the video group:
     pw groupmod video -m <username>
     pw groupmod video -m _dtgreeter

3. Enable seatd, D-Bus, rpcbind, rpc_cmsd, and dtlogin in /etc/rc.conf:
     sysrc seatd_enable="YES"
     sysrc dbus_enable="YES"
     sysrc rpcbind_enable="YES"
     sysrc rpc_cmsd_enable="YES"
     sysrc dtlogin_enable="YES"

4. Start services immediately or launch CDE Wayland from a ttyv console:
     service seatd start
     service dbus start
     service rpc_cmsd start
     service dtlogin start
   (or directly from a user login: /usr/dt/bin/Xsession.wayland)
EOM
}
]
